join Sipho (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
- Ask what happened
	Hope: What happened?
	Sipho: Nothing happened. The queue ran long.
	Sipho: Lebo had the mill apart this morning. He said anyone who wanted to see the gearing could come and look while it was open.
	Sipho: It's open maybe twice a year. He put it back together at ten.
	Sipho: I got back at half past.
- I'm sorry
	Hope: I'm sorry.
	Sipho: Don't. It's fine. It's a mill.
Sipho: It's not that I mind fetching the water. Gogo can't do it. Someone has to and I'm the one who can.
Sipho: It's that I'm always half an hour late to everything that isn't fetching water.
Sipho: That's all. That's the whole of it.
